  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contributing to the Integrated Management of Biodiversity of the Pacific Region of Colombia to Build Peace</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Note: Disbursement data provided is cumulative and covers disbursement made by the project Agency.</narrative>
