  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To mainstream the sustainable use and conservation of biodiversity and the provision of ecosystem services in vulnerable landscapes of the Colombia&#xe2;&#x20ac;&#x2122;s Pacific region in view of generating global and local environmental benefits and supporting the peace process</narrative>
